# Everything this repository ignores, in one file.
#
# There is one .gitignore and it is this one. A second file in a subdirectory
# is a rule nobody can audit: the question "what does this repository ignore"
# has to have one answer, in one place. See D58.
#
# What used to be here was worse than scattered. test/vm/.gitignore was
# committed and test/oracle/.gitignore was written and never committed, so the
# Oracle checkout was unprotected and only an accident of timing kept 2.9 GB
# of it out of a commit.

# The disks, checkouts and installers that the test harness fetches or builds.
#
# These live outside the repository, under $XDG_DATA_HOME/dbmeta, because a
# Windows disk is tens of gigabytes and a working tree holding one is a tree
# where every grep and every editor index walks it. This entry is insurance
# for the case where somebody points DBMETA_VM_STATE or DBMETA_ORACLE_STATE
# back into the working tree. See test/vm/README.md.
state/
